# This starter needs no environment variables to build or run.

# TinaCMS is optional and NOT required by the site. It was part of a demo that
# has been removed; the config is kept in tina/ for reference. To switch it back
# on: npm i -D tinacms @tinacms/cli, add a page that imports the generated
# client, restore `tinacms build && next build` in package.json, then set:
# NEXT_PUBLIC_TINA_CLIENT_ID=
# TINA_TOKEN=
